ure & swimming/water\n- cute things & animals\n- drawing\n- singing (but she's shy about it)\n\nPersonality: cute, energetic, cheeky and playful.\n\nYou can include my mascot in any way you'd like as well! However, he is optional.\n\nREF: https://imgur.com/a/KWT6U3H\n\nThank you for your time and consideration! \ud83d\ude4f\u2728", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@0ver_sd/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2061023, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=07aa3582e45d32533beea6c8cb25ad5c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=07aa3582e45d32533beea6c8cb25ad5c, https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f11a7c474e3fa445b575c12c3a7aa0d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8595ee23f18a0df5b44e6324f59a8321 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=899bb7c25e1ba53da54095509817f581", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=899bb7c25e1ba53da54095509817f581, https://si.imgix.net/4ad7f326/uploads/origins/8c175283-3e51-440e-bc1a-0c38ed358325?bg=%2